Removes player position pointer, arrow, and cursor from all in-game maps across Gothic 1, Gothic 2, and mods (The Chronicles of Myrtana: Archolos, Odyssee, Returning, etc.).

Experience authentic immersive navigation without GPS assistance. Use terrain landmarks, roads, and environmental cues to find your way.

[b]Features:[/b]
- Completely disables the player location arrow on all maps.
- Supports all Gothic engines natively via Union Patch Engine (G1, G1A, G2, G2A).
- Supports mod-specific map harnesses (including Archolos LeGo SpriteMap).
- 100% Standalone and lightweight. Zero performance impact.

